 crates/zed/resources/app-icon-zeo.png    | Bin 0 -> 34719 bytes
 crates/zed/resources/app-icon-zeo@2x.png | Bin 0 -> 111014 bytes
 2 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 crates/zed/resources/app-icon-zeo.png
 create mode 100644 crates/zed/resources/app-icon-zeo@2x.png

diff --git a/crates/zed/resources/app-icon-zeo.png b/crates/zed/resources/app-icon-zeo.png
new file mode 100644
